# Machine state that apps write into stowed config dirs lands inside this
# repo (stow symlinks point here) — never track it. Patterns are **/-prefixed
# so they apply inside every package (common/mac/linux/work).

.secrets

**/.config/raycast

**/.config/zed/conversations
**/.config/zed/prompts
**/.config/zed/themes

**/.config/github-copilot
**/.config/jgit
**/.config/acli
**/.config/configstore
**/.config/hunk
**/.config/cagent

**/.config/herdr/*
!**/.config/herdr/config.toml
